WEBVTT

00:46:56.371 --> 00:47:01.038
and I think it feels so far like the
incentive system is working,

00:47:01.038 --> 00:47:04.204
just as I sort of watch the way that
we and our partners make decisions.

00:47:04.621 --> 00:47:06.871
But if I read it right, the cap on

00:47:07.871 --> 00:47:12.163
the gain that investors can make is
100 Axum. It's a massive call that

00:47:12.163 --> 00:47:15.704
was for our very first round investors.
It's way, way lower.

00:47:15.704 --> 00:47:18.913
Like as we now take a bit of capital,
it's way, way lower.

00:47:19.413 --> 00:47:22.288
So your deal with Microsoft
isn't you can only make

00:47:22.288 --> 00:47:23.954
the first hundred billion dollars.
I don't know.

00:47:23.954 --> 00:47:26.246
It's way lower than after that.
We're giving it to the world.

00:47:26.454 --> 00:47:28.996
It's way lower than that.
Have you disclosed

00:47:28.996 --> 00:47:32.621
what I don't know if we have, so
I won't accidentally do it now.